  "messages": [
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 0,
      "text": "hey Kai, long day. can I dump some admin stuff on you so you remember it?"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 1,
      "text": "Of course, go ahead and I'll keep track."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 2,
      "text": "my mum, Ilse, is having knee surgery on the 14th at St. Brennan's"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 3,
      "text": "Thanks for telling me. Is someone going with her on the 14th?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 4,
      "text": "me, I'm taking the day off. she lives in Leeds so it's a 3 hour drive"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 5,
      "text": "also my GP finally confirmed it: I have mild asthma. got an inhaler yesterday"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 6,
      "text": "Glad you have a diagnosis now. Do you want reminders for the inhaler?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 7,
      "text": "no, it's only for when I run. which reminds me, the half marathon is in 9 weeks"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 8,
      "text": "Nine weeks is a good runway. Which half marathon is it?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 9,
      "text": "the Harrowgate one, in June"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 10,
      "text": "and I have a splitting headache right now, too much screen time"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 11,
      "text": "Sorry about the headache, maybe a break from screens tonight.\n[recalled while thinking] Oren said screen breaks help his eyes\nWant me to hold anything until tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 12,
      "text": "nah just keep it brief"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 14,
      "text": "oh one more: I'm doing Portuguese lessons twice a week now, conversational level"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 15,
      "text": "Nice. Is that for the trip you mentioned?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 16,
      "text": "yeah, two weeks in Lisbon and Porto in September"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 17,
      "text": "So you're planning to move to Portugal next year?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 18,
      "text": "no no, just a holiday. not moving anywhere, I like my flat"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 19,
      "text": "Got it, just a holiday. Sorry for the mix-up."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 21,
      "text": "my sister Hanne might join for the Porto leg"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 22,
      "text": "That would be fun. Does Hanne speak Portuguese too?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 23,
      "text": "she's fluent actually, she lived in Braga for years"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 30,
      "text": "btw correction for your notes: my birthday is the 9th of November, not the 19th like I told you before"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 31,
      "text": "Thanks, I've corrected it to 9 November."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 32,
      "text": "the parcel from the camera shop is arriving tomorrow, I'll need to be in"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 33,
      "text": "Noted for tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 34,
      "text": "what do you think, should I get a foam roller for the training?"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 35,
      "text": "Many runners find one helpful for recovery; a medium-density one is a safe start."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 36,
      "text": "ok cool, ordering one"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_oren",
      "minute": 37,
      "text": "night Kai"
    }
  ],
